  "filter-to-selection": "Screeu gys y reih",
  "other-filters-label": "Screeyn elley",
  "advanced-filter-label": "Screeu ard",
  "advanced-filter-description": "Ta Screeu Ard lhiggey dhyt streng y screeu lesh ny obbreyderyn shoh: == != <= >= && || ( ) Ta ream ymmydit myr scarreyder eddyr ny Obbreyderyn. Foddee oo screeu son dy chooilley Vaghr reih't liorish screeu nyn enmyn as loghtyn. Son sampleyr: Field1 == Value1. Nottiaght: my ta reamyn ayns magheryn ny loghtyn, shegin dhyt ad y choyrt ayns cowraghyn quoat unnaney. Son sampleyr: 'Field 1' == 'Value 1'. Dy lhieggal cowraghyn stiurey unnaney (' /), foddee oo \\ y ymmydey. Son sampleyr: Field1 == I\\'m. Foddee oo neesht ymmodee staydyn y choyrt cooidjagh. Son sampleyr: F1 == V1 || F1 == V2. Dy cadjin ta dy chooilley obbreyder er ny lhaih veih'n çheu-chiare gys y çheu-yesh. Foddee oo yn oardagh y chaghlaa lesh crommaghyn. Son sampleyr: F1 == V1 && ( F2 == V2 || F2 == V3 ). Foddee oo neesht magheryn teks y hirrey lesh regex: F1 == /Tes.*/i",
  "fullname": "Slane ennym",
  "header-logo-title": "Immee erash gys duillag ny boayrdyn ayd.",
  "show-activities": "Taishbyn jantyssyn",
  "headerBarCreateBoardPopup-title": "Croo boayrd",
  "home": "Thie",
  "import": "Cur stiagh",
  "impersonate-user": "Jannoo myr ymmydeyr",
  "link": "Kiangley",
  "import-board": "cur boayrd stiagh",
  "import-board-c": "Cur boayrd stiagh",
  "import-board-instruction-kanboard": "Cur stiagh JSON cur magh Kanboard: nhee lesh \"columns\" (ny obbraghyn lesh column_name) as rolley \"tasks\" (title, description, column_name, swimlane_name, date_due, owner, tags). Hig columnyn dy ve rolleyghyn as obbraghyn dy ve kaartyn.",
  "import-board-instruction-deck": "Cur stiagh JSON boayrd NextCloud Deck (boayrd lesh \"stacks\", as \"cards\" ec dagh stack). Hig stackyn dy ve rolleyghyn as kaartyn dy ve kaartyn.",
  "import-board-instruction-openproject": "Cur stiagh JSON çhaglym work-packages OpenProject (GET /api/v3/work_packages). Hig staydyn dy ve rolleyghyn as pakidyn obbee dy ve kaartyn.",
  "import-board-instruction-issues": "Cur stiagh rolley JSON jeh cooishyn __sourceName__ (__endpoint__). Hig cooishyn dy ve kaartyn ayns rolleyghyn Foshlit / Dooint.",
  "import-board-instruction-asana": "Cur stiagh JSON cur magh obbraghyn Asana ({ \"data\": [...] } veih cur magh Asana ny GET /tasks). Ta obbraghyn er nyn reaghey ayns rheynnyn (memberships); ta obbraghyn cooilleenit goll gys Jeant.",
  "import-board-instruction-zenkit": "Cur stiagh JSON cur magh rolley ZenKit ({ \"title\", \"stages\":[...], \"items\":[...] }). Hig keimyn dy ve rolleyghyn as nheeghyn dy ve kaartyn.",
  "import-board-instruction-trello": "Ayns dty voayrd Trello, gow gys 'Claare', eisht 'Tooilley', 'Prental as Cur Magh', 'Cur JSON Magh', as jean coip jeh'n teks t'ayns shen.",
  "import-board-instruction-csv": "Cur stiagh dty Luoghtyn Scarrit lesh Cromman (CSV) / Luoghtyn Scarrit lesh Tab (TSV).",
  "import-board-instruction-jira": "Cur stiagh yn JSON veih shirrey cooishyn Jira Cloud REST API (GET /rest/api/3/search/jql), ny nhee co-chasley lesh { \"issues\": [...] }. Hig staydyn Jira dy ve rolleyghyn as cooishyn dy ve kaartyn. Foddee oo rolley \"automationRules\" y chur ayns dy chur reillyn stiagh.",
  "import-board-instruction-excel": "Reih duillag-recknee .xlsx ayns aght WeKan (ny columnyn cheddin as cur magh Excel: Ennym, Coontey, Stayd/Rolley, Olteynyn, Cowraghyn, datyn, magheryn reih't). Ta'n chied row ny kione.",
  "import-excel-file": "Coadan Excel (.xlsx)",
  "import-board-instruction-wekan": "Ayns dty voayrd, gow gys 'Claare', eisht 'Cur boayrd magh', as jean coip jeh'n teks ayns y choadan laadit neose.",
  "import-board-instruction-about-errors": "My gheddyn oo marranyn tra t'ou cur boayrd stiagh, keayrtyn ta'n cur stiagh gobbraghey foast, as ta'n boayrd er duillag Dy Chooilley Voayrd.",
