  "heading-notes": "Nottiaghtyn",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Stiurey shirrey",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Foddee obbreyderyn ve ayns shirrey dy yannoo yn shirrey ny s'baghtal. Ta obbreyder er ny hoilshaghey liorish screeu ennym as loght yn obbreyder scarrit lesh daa-phoynt. Son sampleyr, lhieggagh `list:Blocked` yn shirrey gys kaartyn ayns rolley enmyssit *Blocked*. My ta reamyn ny cowraghyn er-lheh ayns y loght, shegin da ve ayns cowraghyn quoat (m.s. `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Obbreyderyn ry-gheddyn:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - kaartyn ayns boayrdyn ta coardail rish *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - kaartyn ayns rolleyghyn ta coardail rish *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - kaartyn ayns cassanyn ta coardail rish *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - kaartyn lesh cooish ta cummal *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - kaartyn lesh cowrey ta coardail rish *<color>* ny *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - giarey son `__operator_label__:<color>` ny `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - kaartyn raad ta *<username>* ny *oltey* ny *obbreyder*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - giarey son `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - kaartyn raad ta *<username>* ny *oltey*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - kaartyn raad ta *<username>* ny *obbreyder*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - kaartyn raad she *<username>* croodeyr y kaart",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - kaartyn bentyn rish boayrd currit da reagheydys *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - kaartyn bentyn rish boayrd currit da possan *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - kaartyn ta cooie gys *<n>* laghyn veih nish. Ta `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ soilshaghey dy chooilley kaart ta shaghnit nyn date cooie.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - kaartyn crooit *<n>* laghyn er-dy-henney ny ny s'jerree",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - kaartyn caghlaait *<n>* laghyn er-dy-henney ny ny s'jerree",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - raad ta *<status>* unnane jeh ny shoh:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - kaartyn ayns y tashtey",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - dy chooilley kaart ayns as ass y tashtey",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - kaartyn lesh date jerrey",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - kaartyn ayns boayrdyn theayagh ny lomarcan",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - kaartyn ayns boayrdyn preevaadjagh ny lomarcan",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - raad ta *<field>* unnane jeh `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` ny `__predicate_member__`. Ta cur `-` roish *<field>* shirrey son gyn loght ayns y magher shen (m.s. ta `has:-due` shirrey kaartyn gyn date cooie).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - raad ta *<sort-name>* unnane jeh `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` ny `__predicate_modified__`. Son reaghey sheese, cur `-` roish ennym y reaghey.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - raad ta *<n>* slane-earroo mie ta soilshaghey earroo ny kaartyn dy ve taishbynit er dagh duillag.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Foddee ymmodee obbreyderyn ve er nyn hoilshaghey.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Ta obbreyderyn cosoylagh er nyn giangley lesh *OR*. Bee kaartyn ta coardail rish stayd erbee er nyn chur er ash.\nYiarragh `__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` kaartyn ayns rolley erbee enmyssit *Blocked* ny *Available* er ash.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Ta obbreyderyn anchasley er nyn giangley lesh *AND*. Cha bee agh kaartyn ta coardail rish dy chooilley obbreyder anchasley er nyn chur er ash. Cha jean `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` agh kaartyn ayns rolley *Available* lesh cowrey *red* y chur er ash.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Foddee laghyn ve soilshit myr slane-earroo mie ny olk, ny lesh `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` ny `__predicate_year__` son yn earish t'ayn nish.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Cha nel shirrey teks geillagh da case.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Liorish bun-reih cha nel kaartyn ayns y tashtey er nyn shirrey.",
