  "r-vars-people-hint": "Myrgeddin: {creator}, {assignees}, {members} (enmyn ymmydeyryn ayns y teks, enmyssyn post-l ayns y vagher «Da») as {customField:Field name}. T’ad gobbraghey myrgeddin ayns enmyn olteynyn, rolleyghyn as cassanyn jeh jantyssyn elley.",
