  "password-length-report-title": "Lhiurid fockle-arrey",
  "recoveryReportTitle": "Aaghey",
  "securityReportTitle": "Tuarastyl sauçhys",
  "event-ipv4": "Enmys IPv4",
  "event-ipv6": "Enmys IPv6",
  "password-change-required-title": "Caghlaa dty fockle-arrey",
  "password-length-filter-all": "Ooilley",
  "password-length-filter-fixed": "Kiartit gys fockle-arrey liauyr dy liooar",
  "password-length-filter-short": "Fockle-arrey ro ghiare",
  "password-length-first-login": "Chied çheet stiagh",
  "password-length-fixed": "Kiartit",
  "password-length-from-environment": "Ta feeuid soit ayns cooish y çhivyr ayns bree; ta sauail ayns shoh goaill ynnyd jee.",
  "password-length-last-login": "Çheet stiagh s'jerree",
  "password-length-login-count": "Keayrtyn çheet stiagh",
  "password-length-no-results": "Cha nel coontys erbee ayns shoh.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Coontyssyn ren çheet stiagh lesh fockle-arrey ny s'giare na'n lhiurid sloo. Cha nel fys ec agh y vrowser cre cha liauyr as ta fockle-arrey, myr shen t'eh ginsh mychione fer giare lurg çheet stiagh; cha vaagys y fockle-arrey ny e lhiurid eh dy bragh. Kiartit t'eh tra va fockle-arrey y choontys caghlaait - ta coontys ta çheet stiagh lesh fockle-arrey giare reesht er ny hoilshaghey myr ro ghiare reesht.",
  "password-length-saved": "Sauailt.",
  "password-min-length": "Lhiurid sloo y fockle-arrey",
  "password-min-length-description": "Ta çheet stiagh lesh fockle-arrey ny s'giare er ny choontey heese. Cha nel çheet stiagh er ny obbal dy bragh er y fa shen.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Lhiurid sloo y chur er bun",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Ta fockle-arrey noa ny s'giare er ny obbal, as shegin da coontys ta çheet stiagh lesh fockle-arrey ny s'giare caghlaa eh roish red erbee elley. Ta caghlaa eh cur dagh seshoon jeh'n choontys magh. Ta fockleyn-arrey LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS as Sandstorm lesh y chirveishagh oc, as cha nel ad er nyn scrudeel.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Ta'n ynnyd shoh nish shirrey fockleyn-arrey jeh __min__ cowraghyn er y chooid sloo, as ta dty fer ny s'giare. Reih fer ny s'liauyr dy hannaghtyn. Eisht ta dagh seshoon jeh dty choontys er ny chur magh, as t'ou çheet stiagh reesht lesh y fockle-arrey noa.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Aght y date da dy chooilley pheiagh",
  "calendar-system": "Corys feaillere (taishbyney dait)",
  "show-unread-changes": "Cowraghey kaartyn caghlaait neayr dosh mee ad y keayrt s'jerree",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Ta kaart va'n ennym, y coontey, ny laghyn, ny lipaidyn, ny olteynyn, ny rolleyn-feddyn, ny coyrtyn ny ny cohaggloo echey caghlaait lurg dhyt y osley y keayrt s'jerree geddyn oirr gorrym er y kaart beg echey, derrey nee oo y osley.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Freill #lipaid as @olt ayns ard-enmyn kaartyn noa",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Tra t'ou reih lipaid lesh # ny olt lesh @ choud as t'ou screeu ard-ennym kaart noa, freill y text shen ayns yn ard-ennym myrgeddin. Jeant magh: ta'n lipaid ny'n olt goaill ynnyd y text.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Cur-jeeragh çhymsagh rheynn",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Freill yn form son kaart y chur rish foshlit lurg da kaart ve currit rish",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Er: lurg da kaart ve currit rish, nee yn form fuirraght foshlit lesh ard-ennym follym son yn nah kaart. Jeh: nee yn form dooney tra ta'n kaart currit rish.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Caghlaa [lipaid] ec toshiaght ard-enmys kaart noa gys lipaid",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Tra ta ard-ennym kaart noa goaill toshiaght lesh [Text] as text elley ny yei, ta Text jannoo lipaid jeh'n kaart (er ny chroo mannagh vel lipaid lesh yn ennym shen er y voayrd) as t'eh er ny scughey ass yn ard-ennym. Jeant magh: ta'n ard-ennym freayll myr t'eh.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Cur reagheyderyn lesh Enter",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "Tra t'eh er, ta broogh Enter sauail ennym y kaart, coontey as reagheyderyn linney elley; ta Shift+Enter cur linney noa stiagh. Tra t'eh jeant ass, ta Ctrl/Cmd+Enter sauail as Enter cur linney noa stiagh.",
  "open-many-cards-at-once": "Fosley ymmodee kaartyn ec y traa cheddin",
  "open-many-cards-at-once-description": "Freill dagh kaart broggit ayd foshlit ayns e uinnag hene. Tra ta shoh jeant ass, ta broogh er kaart dooiney yn kaart va foshlit.",
  "checklist-ding-sound": "Cloie sheean tra ta reih-lettyrn checklist jeant",
  "checklist-ding-sound-description": "Cloie sheean giare tra t'ou cur cross er reih-lettyr checklist. Ass jeh liorish daanjys.",
