  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Ta'n rolley __list__ er roshtyn e eallagh WIP. Aa-choyrt y kaart gys rolley elley:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Ta dagh rolley er y vuird shoh er roshtyn e eallagh WIP. Troggal eallagh, ny gleashagh ny tashtey kaartyn, dy aa-choyrt y kaart shoh.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "Cha row __count__ kaart(yn) aa-choyrt: ta ny rolleeyn oc er roshtyn nyn eallagh WIP. Aa-choyrt ad fer as fer dy reih rolley elley.",
